**Version**: iter-57 (2026-05-28)
**Status**: Design (ready to launch once deploy/verify 1-tile passes)
**Parent ADR**: [ADR-2605281130 §iter-46+ runbook](../../../90-docs/adr/2605281130-jp-ashiba-q2-strategy-satellite-evo-x2-mailer-langgraph.md)
